  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5102.97 Lake Winnipocket",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5102.97 Lake Winnipocket. No person shall operate a vessel at a rate of speed exceeding 10 miles per hour on that section of Lake Winnipocket in Webster north of a line running between Austin's Point on the west to the cottage presently owned by Clinton Frothingham on the east. However, this restriction shall not apply between the hours of 12:30 p.m. and 3:30 p.m. daily.\n\nSource. #8172, eff 9-21-04 (from Saf-C 402.76); ss by #10169, EXEMPT, eff 8-8-12 (formerly Saf-C 402.89) (See Revision Note #2 at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 5100)",
